<title>USA: Advest reinstates quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Advest reinstates quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Advest Group Inc said on Monday that the company reinstated a quarterly dividend with a payment of $0.03 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on April 15, 1997 to shareholders of record as of March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The company last paid a quarterly dividend in December 1990, Advest said. The board voted to suspend dividends in February 1991 primarily as a result of losses at Advest Bank, the company said.</p>
</text>
